 "remarks": "Beautifully renovated four-bedroom home in Darien on a quiet street with water views. The front door opens from a charming front porch to a living room with built in bookcases. This leads to a dining area and a bright, white, renovated kitchen with tiled backsplash and modern appliances. There is a first-floor bedroom, renovated white full bath and den/office. The upstairs boasts three bedrooms and two full baths. There is a basement playroom with a half bath and laundry on the lower level. The back yard and patio complete this charmer. Deeded water access - bring your kayak.",
